# Add newest entries at the top.

* Sat Oct 17 2026 Contributor <contributor@example.com> 1.0.3-1
- Open links directly into Nextmarks from the system's "open with" menu
  (e.g. after scanning a QR code with the Camera app) -- not just via Share
- Copy a bookmark's link from its context menu
- Fix: a link shared or opened while your device was still unlocking could
  be lost instead of opening the save dialog

* Mon Oct 12 2026 Contributor <contributor@example.com> 1.0.2-1
- Rename folders from their context menu
- Edit a bookmark's URL, title, and folder after saving it
- Settings page: server/username shown left-aligned with spacing between
  the two, matching harbour-readeck

* Sun Oct 11 2026 Contributor <contributor@example.com> 1.0.1-1
- Your login is now kept in Sailfish's own secure storage instead of a plain settings file; existing logins switch over automatically.

* Wed Sep 23 2026 Contributor <contributor@example.com> 1.0.0-2
- Share a link from any app via "Save to Nextcloud Bookmarks"
- Log in via Nextcloud's browser-based Login Flow v2 (2FA-compatible)
- Home screen shows the account's folder tree; create/delete folders
- Add or delete bookmarks; preview images/favicons shown when available
- German translation

